# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lean / Lake build artifacts.  `.lake/` alone is ~5.2 GB of dependency
# cache and object files; it is fully reproducible with `lake build`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/.lake/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build logs dropped at the repository root during development.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
BUILD_LOG.txt
final_build.txt
v_build.txt
local_build.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The manuscript is not published from this repository.
#
# `paper/` holds the article sources: manuscript.md, the LaTeX and Word
# builds, the figures, the slide deck, and the scripts that guarded
# them.  The article is archived on Zenodo under the concept DOI in
# CITATION.cff and is attached to a GitHub release as an asset.  The
# sources stay local and are ignored here; this repository publishes
# the Lean development only.
#
# Worth stating plainly: anything that is meaningful only alongside the
# manuscript (final_check.py, verify_dois.py, sync_refs.py) cannot run
# in CI once the sources are untracked, so those checks were removed
# rather than left in place to fail.  The Lean build and the axiom audit
# never read `paper/`, which is why they still run.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/paper/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local preview harnesses for the header figure. They exist to eyeball
# the SVG on a light and a dark background before pushing; they are not
# part of what the repository publishes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/assets/_*.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX and XeLaTeX intermediates.  Pure build output, wherever they
# happen to be produced.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python bytecode.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Microsoft Office owner/lock files (`~$name.docx` appears while a
# document is open).  They are transient and must not be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS noise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
